Activity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>P/U, 3.5 ton hookload, and made TH RT free using link tilt on TDS. Pulled RT to surface for inspection. Observed some damage in rubber on bullnose. Tool ok to be re-run.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-27T22:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-27T22:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">386</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- bop/wellhead equipment</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RIH and landed out at 20.8 m. Engaged threads and M/U RT to TH neck by rotating landing string 9 1/2 turns left with chain tongs, depth after M/U 20.9 m.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-27T22:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-27T22:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">368</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- bop/wellhead equipment</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>P/U and pulled hanger free, 18.3t hookload. Pulled hanger up below rotary.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-27T22:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-01-27T23:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">358</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- bop/wellhead equipment</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Removed master bushings and pulled TH through rotary. Checked 1st tubing joint for radioactivity, not radioactive.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-01-27T23:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><wits